## Functional Requirements
- Default Earth position fixed at canvas center.
- Moon initialized at a fixed orbital radius with tangential velocity.
- Stable orbit for at least 60 seconds without numerical explosion.
- Pause freezes physics but keeps render.
- Time scale multiplies velocity and force calculations.

---

## Deliverables
- Fully executable React + TypeScript project.
- Clear separation between physics logic and rendering logic.
- Deterministic animation suitable for live demo and screen recording.
- Well-commented code explaining orbital mechanics assumptions and scaling.

