### 7. JavaScript Responsibilities
- Convert `"HH:MM"` to minutes
- Calculate pixel offsets and widths
- Dynamically render blocks into `.timeline-track`
- Render hour markers (`00:00 → 24:00`) every 60px

```js
function timeToMinutes(time) {
  const [h, m] = time.split(":").map(Number);
  return h * 60 + m;
}
```

